                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6d5f2471-42f3-3e98-b2bd-e3e23817282b",
                        "entry_id": "5e311f5d-de1e-30bf-935a-d11aa203b934",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Goaty, goatlike."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec0dfea2-1fa5-4484-8c06-e5aae2f072ea",
                                "sense_id": "6d5f2471-42f3-3e98-b2bd-e3e23817282b",
                                "text": "An admirable evasion of whore-master man, to lay his goatish disposition to the charge of a star!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8573c714-9342-4711-98a3-0b52b1b81bce",
                                "sense_id": "6d5f2471-42f3-3e98-b2bd-e3e23817282b",
                                "text": "Many are the men, of every rank, quality, and degree here, who would much rather riot in these goatish embraces, than share the pure and lawful bliss derived from matrimonial, mutual love."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be17aa1f-96e0-4ed2-bbe9-957583ea5c0c",
                                "sense_id": "6d5f2471-42f3-3e98-b2bd-e3e23817282b",
                                "text": "Though I call them satyrs, they showed nothing of the satyr except little horns and a goatish head; all the rest of their form was human."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1838df45-a7d5-4b69-be1c-1d569a876e61",
                                "sense_id": "6d5f2471-42f3-3e98-b2bd-e3e23817282b",
                                "text": "He went through a pantomime of examining a joint of meat, with goatish sniffs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e79d7ecf-b8b1-4016-a2f6-f43370be7759",
                                "sense_id": "6d5f2471-42f3-3e98-b2bd-e3e23817282b",
                                "text": "She was perfumed, and beside the wave of her perfume, Mendel perceived uneasily the heavy, goatish odor of Pavel's sweating body."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
